				""
				"But before you can do that the rods have to be processed by the &2Blazing Agitator&r. Using a little bit of &cpower&r the &2Agitator&r will slowly build up the potenty of &eBlaze Rods&r that are placed in the &9input&r area. Note that &eBlaze Rods&r adjacent to other &eBlaze Rods&r will &o&bimprove the quality and speed&r at which this happens, and also the &6Blazing Generator&r can generate &cPower&r from up to &o&b4&r &eBlazing Rods&r and works best if it can generate &cPower&r &ncontstantly&r."
